  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-o12iqa",
      "text": "He came back again - third time, same dumb face. Don't tell me that's a miracle, Keith, that's just a body that hasn't learned to take a hint.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:void"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-01-34-881Z/days/day-0001.md",
        "extractedDay": 1,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.444Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-iqbfbw",
      "text": "Kid ran headfirst into the chair again, third time this hour - and he still asks if it hurt. No, Keith. Dying doesn't hurt him. That's the problem.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:void"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-05-49-946Z/days/day-0001.md",
        "extractedDay": 1,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.445Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-i1f1kp",
      "text": "Smug looks good on you, General - shame it's the only thing you're winning lately. Roll your dice like you rolled that whole serum line: convinced it'll work this time. I've got one loss and a long memory, so don't mistake the streak for the story.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0004.md",
        "extractedDay": 4,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.447Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-yzjxfb",
      "text": "That sounded like a gun loading, Willy - one eye and you still can't help gloating. Two losses doesn't mean I owe you a story, so keep the grin, lose the commentary.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0004.md",
        "extractedDay": 4,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.447Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-q9835i",
      "text": "New personal best, and he still checks over his shoulder like something's gonna bill him for it.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0004.md",
        "extractedDay": 4,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.447Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-8y07yy",
      "text": "Kevin, 1 and 3 - the dice like you about as much as gravity does. Roll soft, I'll go easy, that's the false rescue, don't believe it. Newcomer still owes me 75 gold, so if you're feeling generous tonight, lose loud.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0006.md",
        "extractedDay": 6,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.447Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-adbgl0",
      "text": "Two-oh doesn't scare me, Count - my streak's a broken bone, it resets whether you like it or not. Newcomer hit a new domain and you're still out here counting corpses that won't stay filed. That sounded like a gun loading, and it's aimed at your own ledger.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "neutral",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0006.md",
        "extractedDay": 6,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.448Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-tgujqk",
      "text": "Two losses don't make you my father, General, and four-and-four doesn't make you lucky - just even odds with a worse haircut. Your new golden boy hits a personal best and suddenly you're smug like it's your legs that ran it. Roll the die before you start collecting on a debt you didn't sign for either.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic",
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0007.md",
        "extractedDay": 7,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.449Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-ubhv3n",
      "text": "Smug looks good on you right up until the dice actually hit the table, General. One loss doesn't scare me - I've bled out worse and still made rent. Rack 'em up, and don't make this sweet when I take your gold.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0004.md",
        "extractedDay": 4,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.451Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-ukkaq2",
      "text": "Two losses and a smug eyeball doing math at me - don't smile, Willy, it doesn't suit whatever that is. Roll again before I start collecting interest in fingers.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0004.md",
        "extractedDay": 4,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.451Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-923ef2",
      "text": "New personal best, huh. Kid's gonna owe the universe a debt he didn't sign for, same as the rest of us - he just doesn't know it yet.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0004.md",
        "extractedDay": 4,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.451Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-ymzu9f",
      "text": "Kevin, sweetheart, 1 and 3 is not a threat, it's a cry for help - and I don't do house calls unless the gold's up front. New guy still owes me 75, so don't think I won't garnish your dice too. Roll, and don't make this sweet.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "scared",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0006.md",
        "extractedDay": 6,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.451Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-8oxquy",
      "text": "Two wins counting a guy who doesn't stay counted - that's not a streak, Body Count, that's a clerical error with a body count. Newcomer hit a new personal best domain, so your ledger's already outdated. Keep smirking, though. It's cheaper than what you'll owe when he comes back a third time.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0006.md",
        "extractedDay": 6,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.452Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-4q7q2o",
      "text": "Two losses don't make you a streak, General, they make you a pattern - and I've stitched worse things shut than your record. Your boy's new \"personal best\" doesn't cover the 75 he owes me either, so don't get comfortable smiling like the house always wins.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0007.md",
        "extractedDay": 7,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.452Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-sg5ixj",
      "text": "Three losses, Kevin. Three. The dice hate me specifically, personally, like they've read my file - and meanwhile the new guy's out there hitting personal bests he didn't even earn the scars for. Seventy-five gold he still owes me, and I'm the one bleeding gold into this table like it's a wound that needs stitching. Don't tell me it evens out. That sounded like a gun loading.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": -3,
      "contextTags": [
        "loss_streak",
        "tilted"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "streak": {
          "type": "loss",
          "min": 3
        },
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0008.md",
        "extractedDay": 8,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.452Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-i5svyz",
      "text": "One win and you're already smug enough to choke on it, Keith. Sit with two losses for a while before you start talking streaks - and tell your new best friend he still owes me 75 gold, that debt doesn't afterimage away.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0009.md",
        "extractedDay": 9,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.453Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-btdltu",
      "text": "Six losses out of ten and you're still reading the sun's mood like it owes you tenure, Maxwell. Newcomer owes me 75 gold and hasn't flinched yet, you're down to what, pride and a library card. Fold before the dice finish the sentence for you.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": -3,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:wild",
        "loss_streak",
        "tilted"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "streak": {
          "type": "loss",
          "min": 3
        },
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0015.md",
        "extractedDay": 15,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.455Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-xe5w1e",
      "text": "Three losses, eleven gold, and Never Die Guy still owes me seventy-five he'll never feel the weight of. Don't tell me the dice are fair, Clausen, I've read your contracts, nothing in this world is fair, it's just badly worded.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": -3,
      "contextTags": [
        "loss_streak",
        "tilted"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "streak": {
          "type": "loss",
          "min": 3
        },
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0018.md",
        "extractedDay": 18,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.456Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-37x411",
      "text": "Eleven gold, three losses, and a walking corpse who owes me seventy-five he'll die before he pays. Real banner day, General. Don't look at me like that, it wasn't a bad beat, it was a bad decade wearing a hat.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": -3,
      "contextTags": [
        "loss_streak",
        "tilted"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "streak": {
          "type": "loss",
          "min": 3
        },
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0022.md",
        "extractedDay": 22,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.458Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-k814nh",
      "text": "Two and seven, Kevin, and you still throw like the dice owe you money. They don't. Newcomer owes me 75, and I'm starting to think the debt's contagious.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": -3,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:dust",
        "loss_streak",
        "tilted"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "streak": {
          "type": "loss",
          "min": 3
        },
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
