        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-stitch-up-girl-lw9if7",
      "text": "Smug looks good on you, Boo, but three of my last losses want a word before you get comfortable. Kid's out there bleeding gold he doesn't have again, same as always, so at least I'm not the saddest wallet at this table tonight.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "stitch-up-girl",
        "name": "Stitch Up Girl",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "annoyed",
