      "text": "Four losses and you're still setting the line, Xtreme. That's not confidence, that's a man betting against gravity with someone else's coat on. I've got eleven gold and a bad mood, so unless you're paying out on the newcomer's next flatline, walk yourself back to the badge gate.",
