      "text": "Nine losses on you and seven on me, Kevin, we could open a support group and still lose the raffle. Newcomer still owes me 75, and the lobby lights are doing that thing where they make everyone look guilty. Don't ask if I'm okay, I will start counting your losses out loud.",
