      "text": "Even numbers under a fluorescent grid can't dress up 36 and 36, Doctor. Fifty-fifty's a coin flip you keep paying to lose. And before you ask, no, I won't front you the entrance fee, the newcomer already owes me 75 and hasn't paid a cent of it.",
